<h2 data-heading="Этап 13. Настройка Nginx на проксирование в Apache" dir="auto">
	Этап 13. Настройка Nginx на проксирование в Apache
</h2>
<p dir="auto">
	В практической работе № 3 Nginx проксировал запросы на тестовый backend. Теперь необходимо убедиться, что он
	передаёт запросы в Apache на <code>127.0.0.1:8080</code>.
</p>
<p dir="auto">
	Открыть конфигурацию Nginx:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> <span class="token function">nano</span> /etc/nginx/sites-available/saas-app
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Конфигурация должна содержать:
</p>
<pre class="language-nginx">
	<code class="language-nginx is-loaded">
		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">server</span></span>
		<span class="token punctuation">{</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">listen</span> <span class="token number">80</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">server_name</span> saas-node-01.local 192.168.1.50
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">301</span> https://<span
				class="token variable"
			>
				$host
			</span><span class="token variable">$request_uri</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>

		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">server</span></span> <span class="token punctuation">
			{
		</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">listen</span> <span class="token number">443</span> ssl
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">server_name</span> saas-node-01.local 192.168.1.50
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">ssl_certificate</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.crt
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">ssl_certificate_key</span> /etc/nginx/ssl/saas-app.key
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">access_log</span> /var/log/nginx/saas-app.access.log
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">error_log</span> /var/log/nginx/saas-app.error.log
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>

		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">location</span> /</span> <span
			class="token punctuation"
		>
			{
		</span>
		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:8080</span><span
			class="token punctuation"
		>
			;
		</span>

		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> Host <span class="token variable">$host</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> X-Real-IP <span class="token variable">
				$remote_addr
			</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-For <span class="token variable">
				$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for
			</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token directive">
			<span class="token keyword">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-Proto <span class="token variable">
				$scheme
			</span>
		</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Если конфигурация уже такая, менять ничего не нужно. Если вместо <code>127.0.0.1:8080</code> указан другой backend, заменить
	его на:
</p>
<pre class="language-nginx">
	<code class="language-nginx is-loaded">
		<span class="token directive"><span class="token keyword">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:8080</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Проверить конфигурацию Nginx:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded">
		<span class="token function">sudo</span> nginx <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span>
	</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Ожидаемый результат:
</p>
<pre class="language-text">
	<code class="language-text is-loaded">syntax is ok test is successful</code>
</pre>
<p dir="auto">
	Применить конфигурацию:
</p>
<pre class="language-bash">
	<code class="language-bash is-loaded"><span class="token function">sudo</span> systemctl reload nginx</code>
</pre>
